# Workers static assets headers for the public web app (pernce.com):
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/headers/
#
# expo-sqlite's synchronous API on web needs SharedArrayBuffer, which
# browsers only allow on cross-origin isolated pages. require-corp rather
# than credentialless: Safari only supports require-corp. Same headers as
# web/vercel.json and src/middleware/appShell.ts. This is a static-assets-only
# Worker with no API paths, so every path gets them (index.html is also what
# unknown paths are answered with, single-page-application fallback).
/*
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
